                <h3>
                    Efficient local production supports responsive supply.
                </h3>

                <p class="industry-insight-summary">
                    Modern packaging customers increasingly value
                    consistency, production efficiency and dependable
                    access to locally manufactured products.
                </p>

                <details class="industry-insight-details">

                    <summary>
                        Read insight
                    </summary>

                    <p>
                        Local manufacturing capability can support
                        closer communication between packaging producers
                        and customers while helping businesses respond
                        more efficiently to changing product,
                        capacity and supply requirements.
                    </p>

                </details>

            </article>

